@startuml
title Smart Campus - Use Case Diagram
left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {
 usecase "Book room" as UC1
 usecase "View availability" as UC2
 usecase "Cancel own booking" as UC3
 usecase "Block room" as UC4
 usecase "Unblock room" as UC5
 usecase "Review usage" as UC6
 usecase "Send booking confirmation" as UC7
}

Student --> UC1
Student --> UC2
Student --> UC3

Administrator --> UC4
Administrator --> UC5
Administrator --> UC6

' why: R4 - confirmation extends Book room only when reservation succeeds
UC7 ..> UC1 : <<extend>>

note right of UC1
R1: Future start; duration > 0 and <= 2 hours.
R2: No overlap between active bookings in one room.
R3: A blocked room cannot accept new bookings.
R4: Successful bookings produce confirmation.

Assumptions: touching bookings do not overlap;
blocking does not cancel existing reservations.
end note

note bottom of UC7
Extension condition: booking succeeded.
Never confirm a rejected attempt.
end note

@enduml